cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this ontology, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "CyberRiskGuardian Ontology (CRGO)"
abstract: >-
  An OWL 2 ontology for cybersecurity risk assessment, aligned with BFO-2020 (ISO/IEC 21838-2),
  that gives formal meaning to the data produced by CyberRiskGuardian: assets, threats,
  weaknesses, risk scenarios, controls, the CRG quantitative parameters and key risk indicators.
  Includes a library of risk scenarios linked to ATT&CK, NIST CSF 2.0, SP 800-53, ISO/IEC 27002,
  Loi 25 and Québec health-information legislation. Labels and definitions in English and French.
authors:
  - family-names: "Léger"
    given-names: "Marc-André"
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
url: "https://w3id.org/crgo/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ITriskMgr/cyberriskguardian-ontology"
keywords:
  - ontology
  - OWL 2
  - cybersecurity
  - risk assessment
  - BFO
  - CyberRiskGuardian
